    "intro_html":  "Tangy salsa verde and roasted green chiles turn plain ground turkey into a Southwest skillet loaded with black beans, corn, and melted cheese over rice. Each bowl brings \u003cstrong\u003e40 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e$5.32\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Big flavor, big portion, small receipt.",
